{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Collide, Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ballistic Brews is a roguelike bullet-heaven about driving tanks and vehicles into swarms of enemies. Each run challenges you to survive 15 escalating waves of nonstop action \u2014 short, intense, and endlessly replayable.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your machine, equip unique weapons, and brew upgrades that shape your playstyle. Do you build a drifting glass cannon? A slow-moving fortress? Or a reckless brawler that weaponizes collisions? Every vehicle feels distinct, with weight, momentum, and handling that make driving and combat a chaotic thrill.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095000?t=1761079425","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/aa3dd013c197bfffbecd5abc2aee0d8ea6f6141a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761079425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/a4c3edb47e7c16b6d69a18590bfccdba31de787d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761079425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/a4c3edb47e7c16b6d69a18590bfccdba31de787d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761079425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive, Collide, Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ballistic Brews is a roguelike bullet-heaven about driving tanks and vehicles into swarms of enemies. Each run challenges you to survive 15 escalating waves of nonstop action \u2014 short, intense, and endlessly replayable.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization &amp; Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your machine, equip unique weapons, and brew upgrades that shape your playstyle. Do you build a drifting glass cannon? A slow-moving fortress? Or a reckless brawler that weaponizes collisions? Every vehicle feels distinct, with weight, momentum, and handling that make driving and combat a chaotic thrill.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Syncarnation Studio Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/db6263c4642d52b57f2df5ec4e2ac311cd5845c3/header.jpg?t=1761079425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4095000/1539072733/a156a15ba80433d7c7f54165dbf37926513edc28/1760129488/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761069547","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4095000/1539072733/a156a15ba80433d7c7f54165dbf37926513edc28/1760129488/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761069547","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4095000/1539072733/a156a15ba80433d7c7f54165dbf37926513edc28/1760129488/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761069547","id":257215849,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215849/movie480.mp4?t=1761069547","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215849/movie_max.mp4?t=1761069547"},"name":"Ballistic Brews Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215849/649521d8647a48db77e4c439218b44771fd1c4b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761069547","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215849/movie480.webm?t=1761069547","max":"https://video.akamai.ste